@@ -190,3 +190,10 @@ Use `$env:USERPROFILE\.linkedin-mcp` when constructing the host path outside JSO
 
 - **Source**: <https://github.com/stickerdaniel/linkedin-mcp-server>
 - **License**: Apache 2.0
+
+### People-search pagination
+
+`search_people` accepts `page` (1–1000, default 1). Request one page per call,
+keeping filters unchanged. Stop on empty or repeated profile URLs, and respect
+rate limits. The page ceiling does not guarantee that LinkedIn exposes that many
+results. Profile downloads remain individual `get_person_profile` calls.
